"""Acceptance tests for handlers/[[ m.path ]]: the hand-written body against the model.

Each test calls one check of seams_runtime.verify and asserts what it returns:
the handler's types against its shapes (handler_types), its result for each
valid example (handler_result), the lifecycle guard of the transition its task
fires (transition_guard), and whether a decision example's route reaches its
task when the process runs in-process with the handlers package
(decision_route). A failing check names the model fact.
"""

